  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This method is used to process certificates send by a diagnostic tester, via the UDS subfunction TransmitCertificate inside the application. There is no specific semantics for the certificate and it is left to the application to process the received certificate and derive the needed actions.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
